SUMMARY:Cancer Thrivers Support Group
DESCRIPTION:The Cancer Thrivers support group is for anyone who is currently experiencing or recovering from cancer. Led by practitioner Kathy Galvin\, in this weekly group you will be able to share your experience and receive support from your peers. \nTo join the group\, please email Kathy Galvin at kgwrites@comcast.net to set up short phone orientation.
